flowchart LR
    %% ===================== LOCAL =====================
    subgraph L["🧩 Local Development (Agentic Build)"]
        direction TB
        A["🖥️ Start Command<br/><b>./jira-sync --implement KAN-XX</b>"]
        B["📜 Story Loader<br/><code>tools/jira_context_sync/implement_story.py</code>"]
        C["🔗 Jira Fetch<br/>Issue pulled via REST API"]
        D["🗂️ Context Artifacts<br/><code>docs/jira/current_story.md</code><br/><code>docs/jira/current_story.json</code>"]
        E["🤖 Copilot Agent Context<br/><code>@workspace</code> reads story + architecture rules"]
        F["🛠️ Autonomous Implementation<br/>MVVM + Compose + StateFlow<br/>Model / Service / Repository / ViewModel / UI / Tests"]

        A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F
    end

    %% ===================== GITHUB =====================
    subgraph G["☁️ GitHub PR (AI Review Pipeline)"]
        direction TB
        H0["📤 Push Branch + Open PR"]
        H1["⚙️ Workflow Trigger<br/><code>.github/workflows/ai-pr-reviewer.yml</code>"]
        H2["🧪 Build Signals<br/>PR Diff + Unit Tests + Lint + Coverage"]
        H3["🧠 Review Context Builder<br/>Prompt + Recent Human PR Comments"]
        H4["🔍 Gemini 2.5 Review Pass"]
        H5["💬 Line-Level PR Comments<br/>Action posts actionable findings"]

        H0 --> H1 --> H2 --> H3 --> H4 --> H5
    end

    %% Handoff
    F -->|PR Raised| H0

